User macros: binding forms, recursion, ellipsis, literals, local shadowing.
$[Import* std]
$[Macro !let1 {{{name value} body} {{^ {name} body} value}}]
${!let1 {x 4} {* x x}}
expect: 16
$[Macro !lets
    {{{} body} body}
    {{{{name value} rest ...} body} {!let1 {name value} {!lets {rest ...} body}}}]
${!lets {{a 1} {b {+ a 1}}} {* a b}}
expect: 2
$[Macro !when {{c body} {!if c {some body} none}}]
${!when true 5} ${!when false 5}
expect: #some(5)
expect: #none
$[Macro !twice {{e} {' e e}}]
$[Macro !thunk {{e} {^ {} e}}]
$[Macro !static {{e} [% e]}]
${!twice {+ 1 1}} ${{!thunk 7}} ${!static {+ 1 2}}
expect: [2, 2]
expect: 7
expect: 3
Dropped operands are never checked or evaluated:
$[Macro !count {{} 0} {{_ rest ...} {+ 1 {!count rest ...}}}]
${!count a b {undefined stuff}}
expect: 3
$[Macro !kw {{"plus" a b} {+ a b}} {{"times" a b} {* a b}}]
${!kw "times" 3 4}
expect: 12
${{^ {} [Macro !if {{c a b} b}] {!if true 1 2}}} ${!if true 1 2}
expect: 2
expect: 1
${!and} ${!or false false} ${!and true {!or false true}}
expect: true
expect: false
expect: true
$[# if 7]
${!if true if 0}
expect: 7
